047013303","src":"곰이의 트래블 루트","thumb":"https://search4.kakaocdn.net/argon/130x130_85_c/LM8fAK4kM1H","date":"2025-10-20"},{"t":"blog","title":"의령캠핑장추천 / 의령 호수랑 오토 캠핑장 / 낚시캠핑장","snippet":"​ ​ ​ 호수랑 오토 캠핑장 📍 경남 의령군 지정면 함의로 1360-5 ​ ​ ⏱️ 입촌 14:00 퇴촌 12:00 매너타임 23시 ​ 1박 45,000 매월1일 20시 2개월단위예약오픈 땡큐캠핑...호수랑캠핑장 🖤 ​ ​ 사이트별로 찍어오진못했고 대략적인 것만 리뷰할게욤. ​ …","url":"https://blog.naver.com/hoiroi/223843928187","src":"우연히 하는 블로그","thumb":"https://search3.kakaocdn.net/argon/130x130_85_c/EN1xrQPj9RT","date":"2025-04-23"}]},"social_checked_at":"2026-10-14T08:22:00+09:00","photos_remote":["https://gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/100815/3181w3kelL4F7zmjH5kX0C1I.jpg","https://gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/100815/2181doTuOUURQnLseKK1LOyt.jpg","https://gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/100815/4441uJXNTPblBMVksra0NVEz.jpg","https://gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/100815/2403yNOPHkzwuJo6CJUaGHv8.jpg","https://gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/100815/2179Jub21sVmMnG8hw6VqlRi.jpg","https://gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/100815/4666PnGEDdQollkVvysoazl0.jpg","https://gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/100815/6652AhfYCCxnPh8CtnGmPlfX.jpg","https://gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/100815/7081Xun7CCWlWxh8ypQ0Xtc9.jpg","https://gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/100815/1745UsTIWrGcdTtENQROFzjm.jpg","https://gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/100815/131719vO7hMHRe3BHsZvbmed.jpg","https://gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/100815/8992YecqUoeSYMbyhJ1aWEvA.jpg","https://gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/100815/3567pUvqhBgThMurUAmrH5fL.jpg","https://gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/100815/1929d1l7Q08fkZfr9fHLtkA1.jpg","https://gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/100815/9358aGEn41P6XiBw1oF8ApwP.jpg","https://gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/100815/5960ApzhLjMfUSGP6oO2eEDt.jpg","https://gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/100815/7547ho60h7wXL61rePISjCGK.jpg","https://gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/100815/31983ZohpayrjiKXEZM9Yevi.jpg","https://gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/100815/2596mnPYmel1ChMxnx9ZqVPo.jpg","https://gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/100815/78077CoHBF9P7CS15qrmP53E.jpg"],"img_dup":1,"photos